Important Points about Law of Supply PAS Direct am Positiv@ 1. It states the positive relationship between price and quantity
supplied, assuming no changes in other factors.
2. It is a qualitative statement, as it indicates the direction of
change in the quantity supplied, but it does not indicate the
magnitude of change.
3. It does not establish any proportional relationship between
change in price and the resultant change in quantity supplied.
4. Law is one sided as it explains only the effect of change in price
on the supply, and not the effect of change in supply on the
